---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import { Image } from 'astro:assets';
import foundersPhoto from '../assets/founders.jpeg';
---
<Layout
  title="Careers · Cytidel"
  description="Cytidel is hiring across engineering, product, and GTM. Build the early warning layer for overwhelmed security teams."
>
  <section class="hero careers-hero" aria-labelledby="hero-h1">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="hero-inner">
        <span class="eyebrow">Careers</span>
        <h1 id="hero-h1">Build the <span class="hi-deep">early warning layer</span> for overwhelmed security teams.</h1>
        <p class="hero-sub">Cytidel is hiring across engineering, product, and GTM. We're a Series-A-track cybersecurity startup giving defenders the platform they need to keep up with a problem that's outrunning them. If you want to build the answer to that, this is the room.</p>
        <div class="hero-cta">
          <a href="#open-roles" class="btn btn-primary">
            See open roles
            <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
          </a>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="awards-strip" aria-label="Awards and recognition">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="awards-band">
        <div class="awards-grid">
          <div class="award-item">
            <span class="award-status">
              <svg class="award-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M7 4h10v5a5 5 0 0 1-10 0V4z"/>
                <path d="M7 6H4.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 2.5 4.5M17 6h2.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1-2.5 4.5"/>
                <path d="M12 14v3M8.5 21h7M9.5 21a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 5 0"/>
              </svg>
              Grand Prix Winner
            </span>
            <div class="award-name">Irish National Startup of the Year, 2024</div>
          </div>
          <div class="award-item">
            <span class="award-status">
              <svg class="award-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M7 4h10v5a5 5 0 0 1-10 0V4z"/>
                <path d="M7 6H4.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 2.5 4.5M17 6h2.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1-2.5 4.5"/>
                <path d="M12 14v3M8.5 21h7M9.5 21a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 5 0"/>
              </svg>
              Finalist
            </span>
            <div class="award-name">Cyber Startup Award, Infosecurity Europe 2026</div>
          </div>
          <div class="award-item">
            <span class="award-status">
              <svg class="award-icon" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.7" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true">
                <path d="M7 4h10v5a5 5 0 0 1-10 0V4z"/>
                <path d="M7 6H4.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 0 2.5 4.5M17 6h2.5a2.5 2.5 0 0 1-2.5 4.5"/>
                <path d="M12 14v3M8.5 21h7M9.5 21a2.5 2.5 0 0 1 5 0"/>
              </svg>
              Finalist
            </span>
            <div class="award-name">ECSO CISO Choice Award, 2026</div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="careers-building" aria-labelledby="building-h2">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 id="building-h2">What we're building</h2>
      <p>Cytidel is the early warning layer for vulnerabilities, threat actors and supplier risk. We monitor thousands of sources continuously across vulnerabilities, threat actors, and the suppliers our customers depend on. We surface what matters before the official catalogues catch up.</p>
      <p>The volume of new vulnerabilities is doubling every two years. Some are being exploited within minutes of disclosure. The systems built to track them, NVD and CISA KEV, are visibly falling behind. Security teams are running on overtime, alert fatigue, and the hope that nothing in the queue is the one that matters.</p>
      <p>This is what we exist to fix. We're putting scale-grade intelligence in defenders' hands.</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="careers-team" aria-labelledby="team-h2">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="team-grid">
        <div class="team-text">
          <h2 id="team-h2">A small team with outsized scope</h2>
          <p>Cytidel is fewer than 20 people. The work we ship is monitored by enterprise security teams in financial services, healthcare, aviation, and public sector. Every person here owns work that an enterprise team would have a function for. The trade-off is real. If you're built for it, the impact compounds.</p>
        </div>
        <Image src={foundersPhoto} alt="The Cytidel founders in Dublin" class="team-photo" loading="lazy" widths={[400, 800, 1200]} sizes="(max-width: 820px) 100vw, 50vw" />
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="careers-values" aria-labelledby="values-h2">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 id="values-h2">What we look for</h2>
      <p class="lead">Five things, in this order. They run across every role.</p>
      <ol class="values-list">
        <li class="value">
          <span class="value-num" aria-hidden="true">01</span>
          <div class="value-content">
            <h3>Make it happen.</h3>
            <p>Beyond proactive. Bottlenecks get unblocked, not escalated. We don't wait for permission to move on the right thing.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="value">
          <span class="value-num" aria-hidden="true">02</span>
          <div class="value-content">
            <h3>No fluff.</h3>
            <p>No specs that no one reads. No status meetings that no one needs. Three-week cycles. Build, ship, learn, repeat.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="value">
          <span class="value-num" aria-hidden="true">03</span>
          <div class="value-content">
            <h3>Restless improvement.</h3>
            <p>The product. The process. Ourselves. We get better in pursuit of the goal, never out of restlessness for its own sake. The work is too important to stand still on.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="value">
          <span class="value-num" aria-hidden="true">04</span>
          <div class="value-content">
            <h3>Trust and autonomy.</h3>
            <p>We hire people who can take an intent and run with it. The autonomy comes with the expectation: own it end to end, make the call, document the why, ship the work.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
        <li class="value">
          <span class="value-num" aria-hidden="true">05</span>
          <div class="value-content">
            <h3>We're on the defender's side.</h3>
            <p>Attackers have scale. Defenders have spreadsheets and willpower. Cytidel exists to flip that. We're here for the analyst running on overtime, the CISO answering the same board question for the fifth time, the team holding the line on a tooling stack that hasn't kept pace.</p>
          </div>
        </li>
      </ol>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="careers-roles" aria-labelledby="roles-h2" id="open-roles">
    <div class="container">
      <h2 id="roles-h2">Open roles</h2>
      <p class="roles-status">No open roles right now.</p>
      <p>We're growing carefully. If you've read this far and the values land for you, we'd rather hear from you now than miss you later.</p>
      <a href="https://www.linkedin.com/company/cytidel/" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="linkedin-cta">
        Follow Cytidel on LinkedIn
        <span class="arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </a>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  /* Container + section defaults */
  .container {
    width: 100%;
    max-width: 1280px;
    margin: 0 auto;
    padding-left: clamp(20px, 4vw, 48px);
    padding-right: clamp(20px, 4vw, 48px);
  }
  section {
    padding-top: clamp(48px, 6vw, 88px);
    padding-bottom: clamp(48px, 6vw, 88px);
  }

  /* Hero — base + careers override */
  .hero {
    padding-top: clamp(80px, 11vw, 140px);
    padding-bottom: clamp(56px, 8vw, 100px);
    position: relative;
    overflow: hidden;
  }
  .hero::before {
    content: "";
    position: absolute;
    top: -200px;
    left: 50%;
    transform: translateX(-50%);
    width: 1200px;
    height: 700px;
    background: radial-gradient(ellipse at center, rgba(128, 252, 19, 0.18) 0%, transparent 65%);
    pointer-events: none;
    z-index: 0;
  }
  .hero-inner { position: relative; z-index: 1; }
  .careers-hero {
    padding-top: clamp(100px, 14vw, 180px);
    padding-bottom: clamp(24px, 3.5vw, 44px);
  }
  .careers-hero .hero-sub { margin-top: 28px; }
  .hero-cta { margin-top: 40px; }
  .hi-deep { color: var(--color-accent-deep); }

  .eyebrow {
    display: inline-block;
    font-size: 0.78rem;
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: 0.14em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-accent-deep);
    margin-bottom: 1.25rem;
  }

  .hero h1 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.028em;
    line-height: 1.06;
    margin: 0;
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-size: clamp(2.4rem, 5.6vw, 4rem);
  }
  .hero-sub {
    margin: 28px 0 0;
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.55vw, 1.22rem);
    line-height: 1.55;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
  }

  /* Shared section h2 */
  .careers-building h2,
  .careers-team h2,
  .careers-values h2,
  .careers-roles h2 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.018em;
    line-height: 1.08;
    color: var(--color-text);
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 3vw, 2.4rem);
    margin: 0 0 24px;
  }

  /* Awards strip (dark contrast band) */
  .awards-strip {
    padding-top: clamp(4px, 1vw, 10px);
    padding-bottom: clamp(16px, 2.2vw, 32px);
  }
  .awards-band {
    background: linear-gradient(135deg, #1f2823 0%, #0e1612 100%);
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: clamp(13px, 1.6vw, 18px) clamp(20px, 2.8vw, 40px);
  }
  .awards-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
    gap: 0;
  }
  .award-item {
    padding: 0 clamp(12px, 1.8vw, 22px);
    border-left: 1px solid var(--color-dark-border);
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }
  .award-item:first-child { border-left: none; padding-left: 0; }
  .award-item:last-child { padding-right: 0; }
  .award-status {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 7px;
    font-size: 0.66rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: 0.13em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--color-accent);
  }
  .award-icon {
    width: 14px;
    height: 14px;
    color: var(--color-accent);
    flex-shrink: 0;
  }
  .award-name {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(0.78rem, 1vw, 0.9rem);
    font-weight: 500;
    color: var(--color-dark-text);
    letter-spacing: -0.01em;
    line-height: 1.35;
    text-wrap: balance;
  }
  @media (max-width: 760px) {
    .awards-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 14px; }
    .award-item { border-left: none; padding: 0; }
    .award-item + .award-item {
      padding-top: 14px;
      border-top: 1px solid var(--color-dark-border);
    }
  }

  /* Section 2 — What we are building */
  .careers-building h2 { margin-bottom: clamp(28px, 4vw, 40px); }
  .careers-building p {
    font-size: clamp(1.02rem, 1.5vw, 1.15rem);
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .careers-building p + p { margin-top: 1.4em; }

  /* Section 3 — Small team */
  .careers-team {
    padding-top: clamp(64px, 8vw, 110px);
    padding-bottom: clamp(64px, 8vw, 110px);
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border);
  }
  .team-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.05fr;
    gap: clamp(32px, 5vw, 64px);
    align-items: center;
  }
  .careers-team h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.6rem, 2.6vw, 2.1rem);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .careers-team p {
    font-size: clamp(1.05rem, 1.55vw, 1.18rem);
    line-height: 1.7;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    margin: 0;
  }
  .team-photo {
    display: block;
    width: 100%;
    height: auto;
    border-radius: 12px;
    background: var(--color-bg-elev);
    aspect-ratio: 3 / 2;
    object-fit: cover;
  }
  @media (max-width: 820px) {
    .team-grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
      gap: 32px;
      max-width: 560px;
    }
  }

  /* Section 4 — Values */
  .careers-values h2 { margin-bottom: 18px; }
  .careers-values .lead {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.4vw, 1.1rem);
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    margin: 0 0 clamp(48px, 6vw, 72px);
  }
  .values-list {
    list-style: none;
    padding: 0;
    margin: 0;
    display: grid;
    gap: 0;
  }
  .value {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 120px 1fr;
    gap: clamp(24px, 4vw, 56px);
    padding: clamp(36px, 4.5vw, 56px) 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--color-border);
    align-items: start;
  }
  .value:last-child { border-bottom: 1px solid var(--color-border); }
  .value-num {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3.2rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    line-height: 1;
    color: var(--color-accent-deep);
  }
  .value-content h3 {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.25rem, 2vw, 1.6rem);
    font-weight: 600;
    letter-spacing: -0.015em;
    line-height: 1.2;
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 0 0 14px;
  }
  .value-content p {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.45vw, 1.12rem);
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    margin: 0;
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .value { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 16px; }
    .value-num { font-size: 2.4rem; }
  }

  /* Section 5 — Open roles */
  .careers-roles {
    padding-top: clamp(64px, 8vw, 100px);
    padding-bottom: clamp(80px, 10vw, 140px);
  }
  .careers-roles h2 {
    font-size: clamp(1.5rem, 2.6vw, 2rem);
    margin-bottom: 24px;
  }
  .careers-roles .roles-status {
    font-family: var(--font-display);
    font-size: clamp(1.1rem, 1.6vw, 1.25rem);
    color: var(--color-text);
    margin: 0 0 14px;
    font-weight: 500;
  }
  .careers-roles p {
    font-size: clamp(1rem, 1.5vw, 1.12rem);
    line-height: 1.65;
    color: var(--color-text-secondary);
    margin: 0 0 28px;
  }
  .linkedin-cta {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    color: var(--color-accent-deep);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 1rem;
    text-decoration: none;
    transition: opacity 0.15s ease;
  }
  .linkedin-cta:hover { text-decoration: underline; }
  .linkedin-cta .arrow { transition: transform 0.2s ease; }
  .linkedin-cta:hover .arrow { transform: translateX(3px); }

  /* Buttons */
  .btn {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
    padding: 14px 22px;
    border-radius: 10px;
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 0.98rem;
    transition: transform 0.15s ease, background 0.15s ease, box-shadow 0.2s ease;
    border: 1px solid transparent;
    text-decoration: none;
  }
  .btn-primary {
    background: #80FC13;
    color: #0b2000;
  }
  .btn-primary:hover {
    transform: translateY(-1px);
    box-shadow: 0 8px 30px rgba(128, 252, 19, 0.35);
  }
  .btn .arrow { transition: transform 0.2s ease; }
  .btn:hover .arrow { transform: translateX(3px); }
</style>
